note bottom of documents
  **Partial unique index**: a carrier can only
  have ONE APPROVED document per type, but can
  retry after a rejection or an expiration.
  UNIQUE (carrier_id, document_type_id)
  WHERE validation_status = 'APPROVED'
  --
  **CHECK**: if status = 'REJECTED', the reason is mandatory.
  **CHECK validation_status**: PENDING, IN_REVIEW,
  APPROVED, REJECTED, EXPIRED (US35)
end note

