trips ||--o| payments : "settles"
shippers ||--o{ payments : "pays"
carriers ||--o{ payments : "receives"
payments ||--o| receipts : "is backed by\nON DELETE CASCADE"

note right of receipts
  Internal entity of the Payment aggregate.
  PDF with the breakdown of fees and
  taxes (US53). UNIQUE (series, number).
  **CHECK**: total = subtotal + taxes
end note

note bottom of payments
  **Split CHECK**: platform_fee +
  payout_amount <= total_amount.
  The database prevents the split sum from
  exceeding what was charged to the shipper.
  --
  **Completeness CHECK**: a COMPLETED payment
  requires gateway_reference and processed_at.
  --
  No card data is persisted: only tokens
  flow to the gateway.
  --
  **payout_status**: PENDING, SCHEDULED,
  TRANSFERRED, with the scheduled deposit date
  that the carrier sees (US54).
end note

