note bottom of ratings
  **rater_id** and **ratee_id** enable the
  mutual rating: it is known whether the shipper rates
  the carrier or the other way around. Without these
  fields the previous model could not distinguish it.
  --
  **UNIQUE (trip_id, rater_id)**: each
  participant rates only once per trip.
  **CHECK**: rater_id <> ratee_id
  **CHECK**: score BETWEEN 1 AND 5
end note

